  "content": {
    "_uid": "5866e5f5-9592-4263-caf3-1bee99add162",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9b0838d4-aede-e659-d26f-510ac8921160",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Along with Dr Bentil, other speakers included Assistant Professor Dr Nicholas Wachira, MEd student Natasha Kassam, IT Manager Arbogast Fabian, incoming Director Joe Lugalla, Head of Research, Professor Anjum Halai, and Pauline who delivered a short but emotional farewell speech.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Pauline was presented with a plaque from her colleagues at AKU and she and her partner, James Dickins, were given a gift of a set of Tanzanian-made bed linens. The highlight of the evening was a 10-minute slide show, \"Down Memory Lane with Pauline,\" featuring a collection of photos of Pauline at various times at IED. The slide show and the entire programme were developed by a planning committee consisting of IED, EA faculty, staff, and student representatives, with oversight and support from the Office of the Provost.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
