    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On June 11, at an event at the New Africa Hotel in Dar es Salaam, about 130 faculty, staff, students and friends of AKU, and IED, EA celebrated Professor Pauline Rea-Dickin's 5-year tenure as director of the Institute and bid her farewell. The occasion was also used to welcome the incoming director, Professor Joe Lugalla. The University was represented by Vice Provost Kweku Bentil who delivered the welcome address and read a personal message from Provost Greg Moran to Pauline and all colleagues at IED, EA.",
